{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>They shall run like mighty men.</b> יעבטון — like יעותון, and likewise in the language of Ishmael."], :book :joel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {0 "The comparison to יעותון (from עות, to bend/run) clarifies the unusual form יעבטון (from עבט); the Arabic parallel supports the reading."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Joel -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/yoel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:06:29.912453626Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}